---
// Business and engineering problems solved, as case cards.
---
<section class="section wrap" id="problems">
  <div class="sec-head"><p class="kicker">Case notes</p><h2>Engineering Problems I've Solved</h2></div>
  <div class="cases">
    <article class="case">
      <p class="case-tag"><span class="case-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Case 01</p>
      <h3>Legacy Modernization</h3>
      <p>Reverse-engineered business rules from a large legacy application and converted them into functional and technical specifications to support modernization.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="case">
      <p class="case-tag"><span class="case-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Case 02</p>
      <h3>Inventory Allocation</h3>
      <p>Designed backend processing for inventory allocation, including FIFO-based business rules, volume calculations, reservations and inventory transactions.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="case">
      <p class="case-tag"><span class="case-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Case 03</p>
      <h3>Distributed Processing</h3>
      <p>Introduced asynchronous processing using messaging to decouple long-running and cross-service operations.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="case">
      <p class="case-tag"><span class="case-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Case 04</p>
      <h3>Database Performance</h3>
      <p>Analysed complex SQL processing and backend workflows to reduce processing time from minutes to seconds.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="case">
      <p class="case-tag"><span class="case-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Case 05</p>
      <h3>Enterprise Integration</h3>
      <p>Designed resilient integrations with ERP systems covering data mapping, validation, retries, error handling and reconciliation.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="case">
      <p class="case-tag"><span class="case-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Case 06</p>
      <h3>Production Delivery</h3>
      <p>Managed deployments, releases, production issues and cross-functional coordination across development, QA, DevOps, infrastructure and client teams.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="case feature">
      <p class="case-tag"><span class="case-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Case 07</p>
      <h3>AI-Assisted Development</h3>
      <p>Introduced specification-driven AI-assisted development into an established engineering team while retaining human review and quality gates.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
